# PowOS: keep sshd enabled.
#
# Bazzite ships 81-desktop.preset with:
#     disable sshd.socket
#     disable sshd.service
# and Fedora's 90-default.preset enables it. Presets are applied in lexical
# order and the FIRST match wins, so 81 beats 90 and sshd ends up disabled.
#
# We compensated with `systemctl enable sshd.service` at build time, which
# writes a symlink into /etc — and /etc is precisely what ostree three-way
# merges on an upgrade, with presets re-applied over the top. So SSH could
# disappear across an update with nothing logged about it, which is how a Deck
# came back from a SteamOS update with no way in.
#
# 80 sorts ahead of 81, so this wins. Paired with a wants-symlink in /usr (see
# the Containerfile), which no /etc merge can touch.
enable sshd.service
